  <!-- The Kernel — governance-as-code deep-dive -->
  <section id="kernel" class="py-24 bg-bg-base border-b border-border-base relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 dot-grid opacity-30 [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_50%_40%_at_50%_0%,#000_60%,transparent_100%)] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-mono text-accent-primary-soft uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">&lt;kernel&gt;</h2>
        <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-black text-text-base">Un sistema nervioso para agentes.</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">dark-memory-mcp no es una librería más: es la columna vertebral de cómo escribimos código. Governance-as-code, no governance-as-policy.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 visual steps: spec → judge → publish -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-14">
        <!-- Step 1: Spec -->
        <div class="glass rounded-xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden group">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-primary-dim border border-accent-primary/30 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-primary-soft" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-text-faint">01</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-text-base mb-2">Escribís la spec</h4>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Antes de una sola línea de código, la intención queda documentada en OpenSpec con tareas, dependencias y criterios de aceptación.</p>
          <div class="mt-4 font-mono text-xs bg-[#0d0d12] border border-border-base rounded-lg p-3 overflow-x-auto">
            <span class="text-accent-primary-soft">dark_memory</span>.<span class="text-yellow-200">vibe_spec</span>(&#123; vibe_case: <span class="text-status-online">'C1'</span>, tasks: <span class="text-text-faint">[...]</span> &#125;)
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2: Judge -->
        <div class="glass neon-border rounded-xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden group">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-primary-dim border border-accent-primary/30 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-primary-soft" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0L6 7m3-1L6 7m0 0L3 6m6-1L6 7m0 0L3 6m9 1h6m-6 4h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-text-faint">02</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-text-base mb-2">Un juez audita el artefacto</h4>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">LLM-as-judge, no LLM-as-author. Cada artefacto se compara contra su spec y emite verdict: aligned, drift_detected o needs_human.</p>
          <div class="mt-4 font-mono text-xs bg-[#0d0d12] border border-border-base rounded-lg p-3 overflow-x-auto">
            <span class="text-text-faint">// verdict persistido en judgment_history</span><br/>
            <span class="text-accent-secondary-soft">verdict</span>: <span class="text-status-online">'aligned'</span> · conf <span class="text-yellow-200">0.98</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3: Publish -->
        <div class="glass rounded-xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden group">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-status-online/10 border border-status-online/30 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-status-online" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-text-faint">03</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-text-base mb-2">Publicás con transparencia</h4>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Todo el ciclo queda en write_audit: quién escribió, qué spec, qué juez, qué verdict. Nada se publica sin rastro.</p>
          <div class="mt-4 font-mono text-xs bg-[#0d0d12] border border-border-base rounded-lg p-3 overflow-x-auto">
            <span class="text-status-online">✓ drift: aligned</span> · <span class="text-text-faint">write_audit #5572</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Live metrics strip -->
      <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-10 gap-y-6">
          <div class="text-center">
